// The VM currently truncates numeric fractional array keys in store_index.
// Node retains the child; the compiler's Stored control above stays conservative.
// RECORD: site 4 kind obj made 1 confined 1 escaped 0 unresolved 0 unchecked 0 routes -
// RECORD-LABEL: fn 72 entries 1 params 0 frame {{[0-9]+}} name mutatedFractionalTableKey
